        "line": 887,
        "text": "theorem actualObservations_eq (F : Profile) {XR C : ℝ}\n    (w : HeatedOutgoing.CompensationWitness F XR C) {p : Point}\n    (hp : p.2 ∈ HeatedOutgoing.parameterDomain) :\n    actualObservations F XR w.coefficients p = observations F (controls F w p.2, p)"
